{"chunk_id": "STD_004_C0003", "source_id": "STD_004", "title": "DB13/T 5390-2021 梨货架期品质维持技术规范", "section": "1 范围", "section_id": "STD_004_S003", "page": 5, "page_end": 5, "pages": [5], "page_basis": "PDF physical page, 1-based", "crop": ["梨"], "region": ["河北省"], "applicable_stages": ["储藏期", "出库期", "运输期", "货架期"], "evidence_level": "A", "source_type": "standard", "year": 2021, "source_file_sha256": "64b3c0db0c947772251d5b0305ddfb03e2fa0efdf94f2cac32dff16dfbfe52d0", "source_url": "https://std.samr.gov.cn/db/search/stdDBDetailedCNF?id=C3B0BB05E84D4F89E05397BE0A0A81E3", "original_path": "data/botou_yali/graphrag_corpus_v1/fulltext/standards/STD_004/original.pdf", "text": "本文件规定了梨货架期品质维持技术规范的术语和定义、货架前和货架期技术要求。本文件适用于梨果实采后流通和销售。", "char_count": 54, "start_offset": 0, "end_offset": 54, "overlap_chars": 0, "text_sha256": "0ceb6f644e6a50b8f16c72a1a13b08097ecb67f755817ca18b7f4a89b4014135", "size_exception": "short_section_or_tail", "review_status": "layout_tables_and_agronomic_context_review_pending", "needs_layout_review": false, "production_retrieval_approved": false}
{"chunk_id": "STD_004_C0004", "source_id": "STD_004", "title": "DB13/T 5390-2021 梨货架期品质维持技术规范", "section": "2 规范性引用文件", "section_id": "STD_004_S004", "page": 5, "page_end": 5, "pages": [5], "page_basis": "PDF physical page, 1-based", "crop": ["梨"], "region": ["河北省"], "applicable_stages": ["储藏期", "出库期", "运输期", "货架期"], "evidence_level": "A", "source_type": "standard", "year": 2021, "source_file_sha256": "64b3c0db0c947772251d5b0305ddfb03e2fa0efdf94f2cac32dff16dfbfe52d0", "source_url": "https://std.samr.gov.cn/db/search/stdDBDetailedCNF?id=C3B0BB05E84D4F89E05397BE0A0A81E3", "original_path": "data/botou_yali/graphrag_corpus_v1/fulltext/standards/STD_004/original.pdf", "text": "下列文件中的内容通过文中的规范性引用而构成本文件必不可少的条款。其中，注日期的引用文件，仅该日期对应的版本适用于本文件；不注日期的引用文件，其最新版本（包括所有的修改单）适用于本文件。GB/T 10650  鲜梨GB 14930.2  食品安全国家标准 消毒剂GB 14881  食品安全国家标准食品生产通用卫生规范", "char_count": 158, "start_offset": 0, "end_offset": 158, "overlap_chars": 0, "text_sha256": "bf0257d9b76948ea5668740ec4c9a27bb8c552542b3d4bfe63ab260a9fe0cd48", "size_exception": "short_section_or_tail", "review_status": "layout_tables_and_agronomic_context_review_pending", "needs_layout_review": false, "production_retrieval_approved": false}
{"chunk_id": "STD_004_C0005", "source_id": "STD_004", "title": "DB13/T 5390-2021 梨货架期品质维持技术规范", "section": "3 术语和定义", "section_id": "STD_004_S005", "page": 5, "page_end": 5, "pages": [5], "page_basis": "PDF physical page, 1-based", "crop": ["梨"], "region": ["河北省"], "applicable_stages": ["储藏期", "出库期", "运输期", "货架期"], "evidence_level": "A", "source_type": "standard", "year": 2021, "source_file_sha256": "64b3c0db0c947772251d5b0305ddfb03e2fa0efdf94f2cac32dff16dfbfe52d0", "source_url": "https://std.samr.gov.cn/db/search/stdDBDetailedCNF?id=C3B0BB05E84D4F89E05397BE0A0A81E3", "original_path": "data/botou_yali/graphrag_corpus_v1/fulltext/standards/STD_004/original.pdf", "text": "下列术语和定义适应于本文件。3.1货架期  shelf-life指果品被贮藏在推荐的条件下，能够保持安全；确保理想的感官、理化和微生物特性；保留标签声明的任何营养值的一段时间。", "char_count": 88, "start_offset": 0, "end_offset": 88, "overlap_chars": 0, "text_sha256": "6af4dd446b2bd4104993a57002d685323123ad7a48de97ead024eaf8f5697882", "size_exception": "short_section_or_tail", "review_status": "layout_tables_and_agronomic_context_review_pending", "needs_layout_review": false, "production_retrieval_approved": false}
{"chunk_id": "STD_004_C0006", "source_id": "STD_004", "title": "DB13/T 5390-2021 梨货架期品质维持技术规范", "section": "4 货架前技术要求", "section_id": "STD_004_S006", "page": 5, "page_end": 6, "pages": [5, 6], "page_basis": "PDF physical page, 1-based", "crop": ["梨"], "region": ["河北省"], "applicable_stages": ["储藏期", "出库期", "运输期", "货架期"], "evidence_level": "A", "source_type": "standard", "year": 2021, "source_file_sha256": "64b3c0db0c947772251d5b0305ddfb03e2fa0efdf94f2cac32dff16dfbfe52d0", "source_url": "https://std.samr.gov.cn/db/search/stdDBDetailedCNF?id=C3B0BB05E84D4F89E05397BE0A0A81E3", "original_path": "data/botou_yali/graphrag_corpus_v1/fulltext/standards/STD_004/original.pdf", "text": "4.1 质量应符合GB/T 10650 规定要求。4.2 保鲜剂宜用1-甲基环丙烯（1-MCP）。4.3 采后48  h 内在密闭空间进行1-MCP 熏蒸，白梨、砂梨、新疆梨处理浓度为0.5 μ L/L～1.0 μ l/L，西洋梨和秋子梨处理浓度0.2 μ L/L～0.5μ L/L，处理时间12 h～24 h。4.4 外包装宜用木箱、瓦楞纸箱、塑料箱等，箱体坚固耐用，无异味，内侧无尖突物。内包装宜采用保鲜纸+网套+箱内垫衬+二氧化碳高通透PE 保鲜膜或打孔膜、微孔膜。4.5 冷藏温度应符合表1 规定，相对湿度90%～95%。表1 梨适宜冷藏温度品种推荐温度（℃）品种推荐温度（℃）黄冠10～15→0鸭梨10～12→0雪花梨红香酥0～1京白梨-1～0玉露香-1～0表1 梨适宜冷藏温度(续)品种推荐温度（℃）品种推荐温度（℃）雪青10～12→0南果梨苹果梨-1～0黄金0～1丰水0～1新高0～1蜜梨砀山酥梨-1～0巴梨早酥0～2香水梨花盖梨-1～0库尔勒香梨-1～0注：梯度降温品种为鸭梨、黄冠、雪青。4.6 果实出冷库后应采取缓慢回温方式，果心温度与外界气温的温差应<10 ºC。4.7 长距离运输温度以 2 ºC～5 ºC 为宜，相对湿度不低于85%。", "char_count": 530, "start_offset": 0, "end_offset": 530, "overlap_chars": 0, "text_sha256": "13526a12f920b07be9529763e55faf3c4e520aca31b1e3f9b59974c1e290d358", "size_exception": null, "review_status": "layout_tables_and_agronomic_context_review_pending", "needs_layout_review": false, "production_retrieval_approved": false}
{"chunk_id": "STD_004_C0007", "source_id": "STD_004", "title": "DB13/T 5390-2021 梨货架期品质维持技术规范", "section": "5 货架期技术要求", "section_id": "STD_004_S007", "page": 6, "page_end": 6, "pages": [6], "page_basis": "PDF physical page, 1-based", "crop": ["梨"], "region": ["河北省"], "applicable_stages": ["储藏期", "出库期", "运输期", "货架期"], "evidence_level": "A", "source_type": "standard", "year": 2021, "source_file_sha256": "64b3c0db0c947772251d5b0305ddfb03e2fa0efdf94f2cac32dff16dfbfe52d0", "source_url": "https://std.samr.gov.cn/db/search/stdDBDetailedCNF?id=C3B0BB05E84D4F89E05397BE0A0A81E3", "original_path": "data/botou_yali/graphrag_corpus_v1/fulltext/standards/STD_004/original.pdf", "text": "5.1 货架场所应彻底清扫、消毒。消毒剂应符合GB 14930.2 的规定，卫生要求应符合GB 14881 的规定。5.2 低温货架适宜温度0 ℃～5 ºC，相对湿度85%～95%。5.3 常温货架期应少于10 d，低温货架期应少于30 d。_________________________________", "char_count": 154, "start_offset": 0, "end_offset": 154, "overlap_chars": 0, "text_sha256": "0fcc4850eb16477f9ce69c62f9642f43992eb2ec4ad8bad4437e85f576b82d74", "size_exception": "short_section_or_tail", "review_status": "layout_tables_and_agronomic_context_review_pending", "needs_layout_review": false, "production_retrieval_approved": false}
